<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Laubharken von Emil und Til – zuverlässige Hilfe beim Laubharken in Gärten und auf Grundstücken." />
  <title>Laubharken – Emil & Til</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --cream: #fff8ec;
      --paper: #fff3df;
      --brown: #7e3024;
      --dark: #52231c;
      --orange: #ef761e;
      --gold: #c87917;
      --line: #d38a2b;
      --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(90, 42, 20, .14);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: var(--brown);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 15%, rgba(239,118,30,.10), transparent 22%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 70%, rgba(200,121,23,.10), transparent 25%),
        var(--cream);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: .18;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(#b66b25 0.7px, transparent 0.7px),
        radial-gradient(#8e3e2b 0.5px, transparent 0.5px);
      background-size: 19px 19px, 31px 31px;
      background-position: 0 0, 7px 11px;
      mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    }

    .leaves {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0 0 auto 0;
      height: 145px;
      overflow: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .leaf {
      position: absolute;
      font-size: 72px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 5px 4px rgba(80,35,20,.14));
      transform: rotate(var(--r));
    }
    .l1 { left: 2%; top: -22px; --r: -28deg; }
    .l2 { left: 15%; top: -38px; --r: 16deg; }
    .l3 { left: 43%; top: -45px; --r: -5deg; font-size: 92px; }
    .l4 { right: 16%; top: -34px; --r: 20deg; }
    .l5 { right: 1%; top: -20px; --r: -25deg; }

    header {
      min-height: 92vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 110px 20px 70px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero {
      width: min(1000px, 100%);
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255, 248, 236, .84);
      border: 1px solid rgba(190, 115, 32, .18);
      border-radius: 34px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      padding: clamp(35px, 7vw, 75px) clamp(22px, 7vw, 80px);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--orange);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 11vw, 8rem);
      line-height: .88;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }

    .brush {
      width: min(620px, 88%);
      height: 25px;
      margin: 26px auto 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ee8c6f, #d95f45, #ef9078);
      transform: rotate(-1deg);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 0 rgba(160,60,35,.08);
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.5vw, 1.65rem);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 52px;
      padding: 0 25px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(100, 40, 20, .16);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--orange);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      color: var(--brown);
      background: #fff;
      border: 2px solid rgba(126,48,36,.2);
    }

    section {
      width: min(1000px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto 70px;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .section-title::after {
      content: "";
      display: block;
      width: 85px;
      height: 6px;
      margin: 13px auto 0;
      border-radius: 99px;
      background: var(--orange);
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 28px 24px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(126,48,36,.12);
      border-radius: 25px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(80,35,20,.08);
    }

    .icon {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .offer {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr .85fr;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .offer-main, .price {
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 35px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .offer-main {
      background: #fff;
    }

    .offer-main h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      color: var(--dark);
    }

    .offer-main ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      line-height: 1.9;
    }

    .price {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f0781e, #d85c18);
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .price small {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      font-weight: 800;
      opacity: .85;
    }

    .price strong {
      font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 10px 0;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }

    .contact {
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.74);
      border: 1px solid rgba(126,48,36,.12);
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: clamp(30px, 6vw, 55px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .phone {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 12px 0 22px;
      color: var(--brown);
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
    }

    .phone:hover { color: var(--orange); }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 16px 45px;
      color: rgba(82,35,28,.68);
      font-size: .92rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      header { min-height: auto; padding-top: 95px; }
      .cards, .offer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { border-radius: 24px; padding: 38px 18px 32px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 18vw, 5.5rem); }
      .hero p { font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.5; }
      .actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 25px; }
      .btn { width: 100%; min-height: 52px; }
      section { width: min(100% - 20px, 1000px); margin-bottom: 45px; }
      .section-title { font-size: 2.2rem; }

      /* Alles auf dem Handy mittig ausrichten */
      .card, .offer-main {
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .card { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .offer-main, .price { padding: 26px 22px; }
      .offer-main h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; }

      /* Listen als Block mittig ausrichten, Text darin sauber linksbündig */
      .offer-main ul, .card ul {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding-left: 20px;
        text-align: left;
        list-style-position: outside;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      .price strong { font-size: 4rem; }
      .contact { padding: 28px 18px; border-radius: 24px; }
      .phone { font-size: 1.9rem; word-break: keep-all; }
      .leaves { height: 90px; }
      .leaf { font-size: 40px; }
      .l3 { font-size: 52px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="leaves" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="leaf l1">🍁</div>
    <div class="leaf l2">🍂</div>
    <div class="leaf l3">🍁</div>
    <div class="leaf l4">🍂</div>
    <div class="leaf l5">🍁</div>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Herbst • Garten • Hilfe</div>
      <h1>Laubharken</h1>
      <div class="brush"></div>
      <p>
        Wir sind zwei 13-jährige Jungs (Emil und Til)
        und bieten unsere Hilfe beim Laubharken an. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne dabei, Ihre Gärten und
        Grundstücke von Laub zu befreien.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/4915566217863" target="_blank" rel="noopener">💬 WhatsApp schreiben</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#angebot">Mehr erfahren</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">Warum wir?</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">⭐</div>
          <h3>Wir wollen selbstständig sein</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Wir zeigen, dass wir zuverlässig sind.</li>
            <li>Wir lernen Verantwortung zu übernehmen.</li>
            <li>Wir sammeln Erfahrungen für später.</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">💪</div>
          <h3>Zuverlässig</h3>
          <p>Wir arbeiten ordentlich, sorgfältig und zuverlässig – damit am Ende alles sauber aussieht.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <div class="icon">🍂</div>
          <h3>Wir haben keine Angst vor Laub</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Kein Blatt ist vor uns sicher</li>
            <li>Wir kommen mit jedem Blätterberg klar</li>
            <li>Kein Blatt ist zu viel</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="angebot">
      <h2 class="section-title">Unser Angebot</h2>
      <div class="offer">
        <div class="offer-main">
          <h3>Laubharken</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Laubharken in Gärten und auf Grundstücken</li>
            <li>Gesammeltes Laub an den vereinbarten Platz bringen</li>
            <li>Ordentliche und zuverlässige Arbeit</li>
            <li>Preis nach Vereinbarung</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="price">
          <small>Preis</small>
          <strong>VB</strong>
          <span>Wir vereinbaren den Preis passend zum Auftrag.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Wichtig</h2>
        <p>
          Sie müssen einen Platz bereitstellen,<br>
          wo wir die gesammelten Laubblätter<br>
          hinbringen können.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Kontakt</h2>
        <p>Interesse? Einfach eine SMS schreiben.</p>
        <a class="phone" href="sms:+4915566217863">+49 15566 217863</a>
        <div>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="sms:+4915566217863">💬 Kontakt aufnehmen</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    © <span id="year"></span> Emil & Til · Laubharken
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
